<div id="box">
== Introduction ==
<div style="padding: 0.5em;">

(http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/fdl.html) in the spirit of which this script is GPL'd. Copyright (C) 2010 [[User:Xaviar Czervik|Xaviar Czervik]]

