The default display name depends upon what type of account it is: {| {{Prettytable}} |- {{Hl2}} !Type !Format |- | Legacy | "{{LSLGC|Legacy Name|FirstName LastName}}" |- | Modern | "{{LSLGC|Legacy Name|FirstName}}" |}
