--[[User:BETLOG Hax|BETLOG Hax]] UTC+10: 20091004 0012 [SLT: 20091003 0712]

<br>
The prims are dimpled, root 0.0-0.5 and child 0.5-1.0
<br>
The child prim is cut 0.375-0.875
<br>
Texture repeats are adjusted accordingly
