{{LSL DefineRow||{{Wikipedia|List_of_HTTP_headers|Wikipedia:List of HTTP headers}}}}
|notes=
* There is no specific function to set HTTP headers. Use [[llHTTPRequest]] with [[HTTP_CUSTOM_HEADER]] for requests. There is no way to set headers for responses.
|deepnotes=
