|func_footnote=Returns {{LSL Const|NULL_KEY|key|&quot;00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&quot;|c=Evaluates to false in conditionals just like invalid keys.}} if permissions were neither granted nor declined (e.g., the permissions dialog was cancelled or otherwise ignored).
