|p2_type=float|p2_name=v|p2_desc=vertical (y) scale in the interval {{Interval|lte=100.0|gte=-100.0|center=v}}|p2_hover=vertical (y) scale in the interval {{Interval/Text|lte=100.0|gte=-100.0|center=v}}
