{{LSL_Function |inject-2={{Issues/SVC-7631}}{{Issues/BUG-5656}} |func_sleep=0.0|func_energy=10.0 |func=llTransferOwnership |return_type=integer |p1_type=key|p1_name=agent_id|p1_desc=Agent ID for the avatar to receive ownership of the object |p2_type=integer|p2_name=flags|p2_desc=Flags controlling transfer behavior. |p3_type=list|p3_name=options|p3_desc=Options applied to the ownership transfer. No options are defined at this time. |func_footnote |func_desc=Transfer ownership of the object containing this script to {{LSLP|agent_id}}. |return_text=indicating the result of the transfer. |spec= Transfers ownership of an object rezzed in world to {{LSLP|agent_id}}. The object must be transferable by its current owner and must not be an attachment.
