===Transfer Errors===

{{{!}} class="sortable" {{Prettytable|style=margin-top:0;}}
{{!}}-{{Hl2}}
! {{!}} Constant
! title="Value" {{!}}
{{!}} Description 
{{!}}-
{{!}}{{LSL Const|TRANSFER_OK|integer|0}}
{{!}}{{#var:value}}
{{!}} No error detected, inventory transferred
{{!}}-
{{!}}{{LSL Const|TRANSFER_BAD_OPTS|integer|-1}}
{{!}} {{#var:value}}
{{!}} A bad option was passed in the options list.
{{!}}-
{{!}}{{LSL Const|TRANSFER_NO_TARGET|integer|-2}}
{{!}} {{#var:value}}
{{!}} Could not find the receiving agent in the current region.
{{!}}-
{{!}}{{LSL Const|TRANSFER_THROTTLE|integer|-3}}
{{!}} {{#var:value}}
{{!}} Transfer rate exceeded the inventory transfer throttle.
{{!}}-
{{!}}{{LSL Const|TRANSFER_NO_ITEMS|integer|-4}}
{{!}} {{#var:value}}
{{!}} The list of items was empty or contained only non-transferable items.
{{!}}-
{{!}}{{LSL Const|TRANSFER_BAD_ROOT|integer|-5}}
{{!}} {{#var:value}}
{{!}} The root path specified in TRANSFER_DEST contained an invalid directory or was reduced to nothing.
{{!}}-
{{!}}{{LSL Const|TRANSFER_NO_PERMS|integer|-6}}
{{!}} {{#var:value}}
{{!}} The object does not have transfer permissions.
{{!}}-
{{!}}{{LSL Const|TRANSFER_NO_ATTACHMENT|integer|-7}}
{{!}} {{#var:value}}
{{!}} Can not transfer ownership of an attached object.
{{!}}-
{{!}}}

