=== Indexes ===
<div style="display:table;"><div style="display:block;">
*Positive indexes count from the beginning, the first item being indexed as <code>0</code>, the last as <code>({{{length|length}}} - 1)</code>.
</div></div>
<div style="display:table;"><div style="display:block;">
*Negative indexes count from the far end, the first item being indexed as <code>-{{{length|length}}}</code>, the last as <code>-1</code>. 
</div></div>
}}
}}
